 more proud to see the progress we have made against our long-term ambition announced a little more than a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2024 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2025-03-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"And at the same time, 2024 already allow us to start streaming on beyond 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2024 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2025-03-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"This already implies an anticipated headwind to our reported gross profit margin from the current U.S. dollar to Swiss franc FX levels, which is expected to offset a further margin improvement driven by the continued expansion of our DTC channel as well as the ongoing premiumization of our brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2024 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marc Maurer","x":"And we want to streamline that when I continue to work on the consumer promise and that should overall result in an even stronger sell-through on the overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2025-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"The strength of our direct to consumer business and its increased share resulted in an increased gross profit margin of 59.9%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2025-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"While we ended the remainder of the year with a lot of tailwind, the ongoing discussions and pending decisions surrounding potential incremental tariffs in the United States introduce a considerable degree of uncertainty into our planning and may create a dynamic market environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2025-05-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"This includes the additional tariffs in place during the 90 day pause period, the risk for increased tariffs and freight expenses as well as general volatility within the global supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2025-05-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"Introduced at a price point above its predecessor, the Cloud 6 reflects how our premium positioning enables pricing power without compromising consumer demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2025-05-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"And this has really put us in a strong position to have earned pricing power in the different markets that we are in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Allemann","x":"At the same time, our Direct-to-Consumer business, both online and in physical retail is a key highlight with a particularly strong performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"And that's, of course, fueled by our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"David Allemann","x":"With robust productivity growth in existing own retail doors, we are confident to scale on retail to create further balance between on wholesale and DTC channels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"Our DTC channel delivered another exceptional quarter, demonstrating incredible momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"This increased outlook already includes the impact of a 20% incremental tariff on imports to the U.S. from Vietnam and the 10% assumed in our previous guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"I think if we look at EBITDA and tariffs, also here, maybe a bit longer answer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"We implemented selective price increases in the U.S. in early July, so these did not have any effect on our Q2 profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/on-holding-onon-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2025-08-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"We have done price increases as of 