and still expand our profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/on-holding-onon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2026-03-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"Alongside the raise of our 2023 to 2026 top-line CAGR, we expect a full-year gross margin of at least 63%—above our 2025 result—despite the additional impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/on-holding-onon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Allemann","x":"The consistent and strong demand we see at this premium price point is a profound validation of our premium pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/on-holding-onon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2025 Q4","e":"onon","d":"2026-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"And then to the gross profit margin, really, the fundamental driver here is our premium position and, with that, the pricing power that we have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/03/on-holding-onon-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"Growth was once again led by our direct-to-consumer channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"Within direct-to-consumer, our own stores continue to elevate the physical brand experience for our fans in key cities around the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"We are currently selling several hundred pairs a day in our DTC channels alone.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"In Q1, 18- to 24-year-olds significantly increased their share of our DTC customer base, the largest increase we have seen since our data began, and this trend has accelerated into early Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martin Hoffmann","x":"Despite significant investments into performance of our products, our ASP strength combined with new levels of operational excellence allowed us to deliver a further step change in gross profit margin despite the increasing headwind from higher U.S. tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q1","e":"onon","d":"2026-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Caspar Coppetti","x":"On gross margin, we now expect a full year level of at least 64.5%, materially ahead of 2025 despite the additional impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/on-onon-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"David Allemann","x":"The strongest proof of the connection we are building is the extraordinary strength of our direct-to-consumer channel, the most premium expression of our brand, which delivered exceptional momentum in Q2, growing 34% at constant currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Growth was strongly led by direct-to-consumer, our most elevated channel, our highest margin channel and the clearest read we have on our brand momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Net sales in DTC reached CHF 388 million, up 34.3% at constant currency and by 26.0% on a reported basis, lifting DTC to a second quarter record of 45.7% of sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Growth was more moderate, 12.7% at constant currency and 4.8% reported, with DTC outperforming wholesale in every region.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Together with a favorable freight mix and some positive foreign exchange effects, those efficiencies let us fully absorb external pressures, including higher U.S. import tariffs and still expand our gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"To be clear, these numbers do not include any tariff refunds, which we anticipate are likely to come throughout half 2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q2","e":"onon","d":"2026-08-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"And hence, also, we lifted the outlook a bit from the -- basically, at the 64.5% to 65% plus as we now see that, basically, the DTC mix, in particular, is trending favorable, and we believe that also to remain the case for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/on-onon-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Direct-to-consumer grew 24.8% at constant currency and 25.0% reported to CHF 393.3 million, almost twice the rate of wholesale, and another exceptional quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Our DTC share reached 42.2%, up 2.6 percentage points year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Full price discipline led by our newest technologies, the sourcing and manufacturing efficiencies that come with strong execution, and a scale and a higher DTC share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Adrienne Yih-Tennant","x":"And my follow-up question is on AI and the investments that you're making there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"A gross margin of 66.9%, excluding tariff refunds, the highest in our history.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"Moving down the P&L. Gross margin, excluding the tariff refund, was 66.9%, the highest in our history.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"We are reiterating our outlook for full year net sales growth in the low 20s at constant currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONON 2026 Q3","e":"onon","d":"2026-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Frank Sluis","x":"On gross margin, we are raising our outlook from at least 65% to around 66%, excluding tariff refunds, reflecting our full price commitment, our higher DTC share and the efficiencies that come with scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/on-holding-onon-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[59,1,5697,0,0,0,5212,276],[60,1,8701,0,0,0,7897,415],[61,1,7985,0,0,0,7068,617],[62,1,7891,0,0,0,7243,479],[64,1,7538,0,0,0,6627,670],[65,1,8397,0,0,0,6923,878],[66,1,8235,0,0,0,6910,1070],[67,1,8686,0,0,0,7402,1030]],"cinema":[[59,1,5697,0,0,0,5212,276],[60,1,8701,0,0,0,7897,415],[61,1,7985,0,0,0,7068,617],[62,1,7891,0,0,0,7243,479],[64,1,7538,0,0,0,6627,670],[65,1,8397,0,0,0,6923,878],[66,1,8235,0,0,0,6910,1070],[67,1,8686,0,0,0,7402,1030]],"imax":[[59,1,5697,0,0,0,5212,276],[60,1,8701,0,0,0,7897,415],[61,1,7985,0,0,0,7068,617],[62,1,7891,0,0,0,7243,479],[64,1,7538,0,0,0,6627,670],[65,1,8397,0,0,0,6923,878],[66,1,8235,0,0,0,6910,1070],[67,1,8686,0,0,0,7402,1030]],"streaming":[[59,1,5697,0,0,0,5212,276],[60,1,8701,1,1,0,7897,415],[61,1,7985,1,1,0,7068,617],[62,1,7891,2,2,0,7243,479],[64,1,7538,2,2,0,6627,670],[65,1,8397,3,3,0,6923,878],[66,1,8235,3,3,0,6910,1070],[67,1,8686,1,1,0,7402,1030]],"dtc":[[59,1,5697,0,0,0,5212,276],[60,1,8701,1,1,0,7897,415],[61,1,7985,1,1,0,7068,617],[62,1,7891,16,15,1,7243,479],[64,1,7538,3,2,1,6627,670],[65,1,8397,5,5,0